              14                     !------------------------------------------------------------------
              15                           implicit none
              16                     !      m.tiedtke         e.c.m.w.f.     12/89
              17                     !***purpose
              18                     !   -------
              19                     !          this routine interpolates large-scale fields of t,q etc.
              20                     !          to half levels (i.e. grid for massflux scheme),
              21                     !          and initializes values for updrafts and downdrafts
              22                     !***interface
              23                     !   ---------
              24                     !          this routine is called from *cumastr*.
              25                     !***method.
              26                     !  --------
              27                     !          for extrapolation to half levels see tiedtke(1989)
